BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:🚧 Suffragette line: Woodgrange Park to Barking Riverside
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261227
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261230
DTSTAMP:20261116T000000Z
UID:1d2cc61cc8e9c3340c6b@tfl-closures
CATEGORIES:Part of the line closed
DESCRIPTION:🚧 Part of the line closed\n\nWoodgrange Park to Barking Riv
 erside\nDates as listed by TfL: Sunday 27 December to Tuesday 29 December 
 2026\nTfL's PDF lists this closure in more than one week\; it's shown here
  as one event.\n\nTfL live status (Part Closure\, checked 21 November 2026
 ): SUFFRAGETTE LINE: Sunday 27\, Monday 28 and Tuesday 29 December\, no se
 rvice between Woodgrange Park and Barking Riverside. Replacement bus servi
 ce T operates between Woodgrange Park\, East Ham and Barking\, use local L
 ondon Buses services for Barking Riverside.\nTfL live status (Reduced Serv
 ice\, checked 21 November 2026): SUFFRAGETTE LINE: Sunday 27\, Monday 28 a
 nd Tuesday 29 December\, a reduced service operates between Gospel Oak and
  Woodgrange Park. Trains operate every 20 minutes. In addition\, on Monday
  only\, the 0543 and 0557 first trains from Woodgrange Park to Gospel Oak 
 will not run\, please use the 0612 service instead.\n\nSource: TfL planned
  track closures\, correct at Monday 16 November 2026. https://tfl.gov.uk/a
 pi/document/plannedtrackclosures.pdf?id=accc98cf-e761-47b3-a43b-3de08a097b
 8f&type=document\nPlans can change. Check before you travel: https://tfl.g
 ov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/\nPowered by TfL Open Data\nUnofficial ca
 lendar\, not produced or endorsed by Transport for London.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
END:VEVENT
